    {
      "version": "1.0.10",
      "release_date": "2026-08-04",
      "headline": "修复:客户端 IsSafePlan 硬编码 xindong/aris 前缀,导致新仓库下所有自动下载被拒",
      "pull_request_count": 1,
      "commit_count": 1,
      "source": "GitHub Releases",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "问题修复",
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "Cindy",
              "list": [
                {
                  "title": "IsSafePlan 与恢复元数据校验不再硬编码 xindong/aris",
                  "description": "src/platform/update_http_transport.cpp:76 (IsSafePlan) 和 src/platform/update_persistence_port.cpp:692 (ObserveResumeMetadata) 都硬编码了 https://github.com/xindong/aris/releases/download/ 前缀。今天早上把发布仓库迁到 zhongziyu-cmd/aris-releases 后,manifest 里的 asset.url 变了,但这两个校验点没跟着改,导致所有下载在 IsSafePlan 阶段就 return InvalidPlan。改成使用 ARIS_UPDATE_GITHUB_RELEASE_DOWNLOAD_PREFIX 宏(与其他 URL 校验点一致),仓库迁移只需改一处 CMake 参数即可全局生效。",
                  "source": "Aris updater black-box tests"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "contributors": [
        "Cindy",
        "Cindy"
      ]
    },
