    {
      "version": "1.0.8",
      "release_date": "2026-08-04",
      "headline": "下载错误覆盖 HTTP 传输层全部失败路径",
      "pull_request_count": 1,
      "commit_count": 1,
      "source": "GitHub Releases",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "问题修复",
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "Cindy",
              "list": [
                {
                  "title": "InvalidPlan/SinkRejected/Cancelled 也带具体细节",
                  "description": "v1.0.6 只让 sink 内部的失败点带具体 detail;HTTP 传输层本身返回 InvalidPlan/SinkRejected/Cancelled 时,sink.errorDetail() 是空,line 692 fallback 到笼统的 update protocol failure。改成所有 HttpTransportExecutionError 分支都合成具体 detail,并把 WinInet/系统错误码 systemError 也带上,方便定位 timeout/DNS/连接被拒/SSL 等真实 bug。",
                  "source": "Aris updater black-box tests"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "contributors": [
        "Cindy",
        "Cindy"
      ]
    },
